# Players may not consult notes, computers, outside information (preference)

Standing user preference: Players may not consult notes, computers, outside information sources, or other people during a game; mobile phone usage is banned due to concerns about engine assistance and outside communication.

## Conventions
- Players may not consult notes, computers, outside information sources, or other people during a game; mobile phone usage is banned due to concerns about engine assistance and outside communication.

